From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 00:39:34 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] DVDInputStreamBluray: hold BD-J notifications until presented

libbluray tells a BD-J application of marks, play items, the playlist
end and playback start at the read, over a second before the picture
shows. A seek it makes at a held mark must drop the data read past it,
but only key-driven seeks did.
